    "title": "Player of the Game: Austintown Fitch's Kylie Folkwein - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Chad Krispinsky ,\n1 hours ago\nCOLUMBIANA, Ohio (WKBN) – Austintown Fitch senior Kylie Folkwein was named Player of the Game for her efforts in the Falcons’ win over Crestview in straight sets on Wednesday night.\nThe game was televised live as the WKBN High School Volleyball Game of the Week.\nFollowing the victory, Folkwein spoke with WKBN’s Chad Krispinsky.\nWatch the video above to see her complete postgame interview.\nFolkwein finished with 17 kills, hitting .324 with 7 digs and 3 aces in the win for the Falcons.\nCopyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WKBN.com.",
